      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Quartum, ne aliquis recipiat alterius hominem sine licentia eius cui ante folgavit nec intra mercam nec extra;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Fourthly, no one receive a man who has been in the service of another, without the permission of him he has been serving, whether within our borders or beyond them.</ab>
